What number is printed when this program runs?

```python
def depth(s):
    st, best = [], 0
    for ch in s:
        if ch in "([":
            st.append(ch)
            best = max(best, len(st))
        elif ch in ")]":
            if not st or "([".index(st.pop()) != ")]".index(ch):
                return -1
    return best if not st else -1

print(depth("([()[]])") * 10 + depth("([)]") + depth("(()"))
```
